OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies racist murder of
OL,4,Ascientist in Dundee as trial date set
OL,5,Afor 2028
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man has denied the
OL,8,Fracially-aggravated murder of a
OL,9,Fscientist on a Dundee street.
OL,11,FKyler Rattray, 21, is accused of
OL,12,Fattacking Dr Fortune Gomo in South
OL,13,FStreet in July last year.
OL,15,FProsecutors allege the 39-year-old
OL,16,Facademic was repeatedly struck on the
OL,17,Fbody with a knife and that the attack
OL,18,Fwas aggravated by prejudice relating to
OL,19,Frace, colour nationality or ethnicity.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
