OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies racist murder of
OL,4,Ascientist in Dundee as trial date set
OL,5,Afor 2028
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe trial is due to begin on 5 January
OL,8,F2028 at the High Court in Dundee and is
OL,9,Fexpected to last eight days.
